Output pip.gif

Set Shell bash
Set FontFamily "JetBrainsMono Nerd Font"
Set Theme "nord"
Set WindowBar Colorful
Set Height 800

Hide
Type "rm -rf .venv && clear" Enter
Show

Type "python -m venv .venv" Sleep 500ms Enter
Wait Sleep 500ms
Type "source .venv/bin/activate" Sleep 500ms Enter
Wait Sleep 500ms
Type "pip install niripy" Sleep 500ms Enter
Wait Sleep 3s

